    "q-104976": {
      "dom_id": "step-q104976",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14193250/assets/e03f453156d57af94b13b76e22dc366644b18f56acc5f9a5f4a2c005e6bec3f7.png)\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the graph of the function $y=f(x)$ shown above?\n\nI. ${lim}_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(h)-f(0)}{h}=0$\n\nII. ${lim}_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(1+h)-f(1)}{h}=-1$\n\nIII. ${lim}_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(3+h)-f(3)}{h}=-1$",
      "worked_solution": "Comparing these limits with the formula for the instantaneous rate of change\n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(a)={lim}_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(a+h)-f(a)}{h},\n$$\n\nwe see that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(h)-f(0)}{h} & ={f}^{′}(0), \\\\ {lim}_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(1+h)-f(1)}{h} & ={f}^{′}(1), \\\\ {lim}_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(3+h)-f(3)}{h} & ={f}^{′}(3).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe function consists of three line segments. Inspecting the graph, we see that\n\n- for $-4<x<-1$, we have ${f}^{′}(x)=-1,$\n\n- for $-1<x<1$, we have ${f}^{′}(x)=0,$\n\n- for $1<x<4$, we have ${f}^{′}(x)=-1,$\n\n The derivative does not exist at $x=\\pm 1.$ So, we have  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(h)-f(0)}{h} & =0, \\\\ {lim}_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(1+h)-f(1)}{h} & =\\text{DNE}, \\\\ {lim}_{h\\to 0}\\frac{f(3+h)-f(3)}{h} & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, only statements I and III are true.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-104976-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I and II only",
              "html": "I and II only\n"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-104976-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "III only",
              "html": "III only\n"
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-104976-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I only",
              "html": "I only\n"
            },
            {
              "option": "d",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-104976-d",
